From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: My Workspace patches <claude@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 21:29:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] deps: upgrade modules with fixed high-severity advisories

Upgrade golang.org/x/net to v0.60.0, golang.org/x/image to v0.45.0,
github.com/klauspost/compress to v1.18.7, google.golang.org/grpc to
v1.83.2 and github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4 to v4.1.6 (pulled in by the
newer grpc); the minimum versions they require bring golang.org/x/crypto
v0.57.0, golang.org/x/text v0.42.0 and go.opentelemetry.io/otel v1.44.0.
x/net v0.60.0 requires Go 1.26.
---
 go.mod |  82 ++++++++++--------
 go.sum | 262 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------------------
 2 files changed, 159 insertions(+), 185 deletions(-)

